From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 20:00:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove Zed-account / sign-in UI from title bar

Removes the title bar's Sign In button, the account dropdown
(render_user_menu_button: plan chip, organizations, billing/account-url,
sign-out), the PlanChip component, and the show_sign_in setting. These are
Zed-Cloud account/subscription UI.

Kept: the onboarding announcement banner (generic feature notices, not
cloud), the RPC connection-status indicator, project-host display, and the
user_store field (still used by project-host display).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
